# Android 15 guest runtime · generated images and build outputs
#
# Only source (C/C++/Java/Python/shell, lists, patches, headers) is committed.
# Everything below is either multi-GB guest material or reproducible output.

# Generated prepared runtime (assets + jniLibs staged for the APK)
prepared/

# Redroid 15 image: layer tarballs, extracted rootfs, and the path index
downloads/
rootfs/
rootfs-index.json

# Build outputs
artifacts/
logs/
build/
runtime/build/
runtime/upstream/
runtime/downloads/
runtime/__pycache__/
bridges/lib/
bridges/bin/
bridges/obj/
bridges/graphics/lib/
bridges/graphics/obj/
**/__pycache__/

# Graphics sources fetched by scripts/fetch-graphics-sources.sh (pinned commits;
# third_party/graphics/{container,a9/{generated,definitions,framework,patches}} is
# committed, only the downloaded upstream tree is not).
# third_party/graphics/a9/upstream is committed: the pinned goldfish/qemu
# sources are small (6.2 MB) and fetching them from gitiles is rate-limited
# (HTTP 429) and incomplete for this build. The fetch script stays as a
# fallback for a deliberately pruned checkout.

# Local tool output
*.log
*.o
*.rsp
*.elf.txt
*.dex.json

# ROM 包产物（每个 0.5–1.6 GB，由 rom/pack-rom.py 产出；进了仓库就是灾难）
dist/

# 构建失败日志（*.log 已覆盖；显式留一行说明它是本地证据，不是源码）
scripts/build-logs/
